                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This little app is a waste of money . you can't help but trigger the Marimba twice ( giving a double note ) often  time you hit a key as the mallet goes through the surface of the key and then triggers the note again as you lift the mallett up to play another note . Its a fundamental problem that needs to be fixed for this to be more than a flakey tech demo . I thought there was stutter until i worked out what was happening .\n\nCould have promise for some fun otherwise . Also the sustain on the notes is too short particularly on the lower notes .",
